{"id":3722343940170,"title":"NEEWER NP-F550 Battery Charger Set for Sony","handle":"batteries-chargers-66600244","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0225\/2960\/5706\/files\/NP-F500_A_1500.jpg?v=1784801648\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDescriptions\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNEEWER Replacement Batteries feature a higher-density 2600mAh capacity.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSecure Construction, Reliable Charging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn real-life usage, this translates to up to 4 hours of video recording per battery so don't be afraid to run out of battery power when you're just about to capture the perfect moment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with SONY CD-RV100 RV200 SC SERIES SC5 SC5 SC5 E SC55 SC55E SC6 SC65 SC7 SC7 E SC8 E SC9 TR SERIES TR1 TR11 TR1100E TR12 TR18 TR18E TR1E TR2 TR200 TR205 TR215 TR2200E TR2300 TR2300E TR280PK TR290PK TR3 TR3 TR300 TR3000 TR3000E TR3100E TR311E TR315 TR315E TR317 TR3200E TR3300 TR3300E TR411E TR412E TR413 TR414 TR415E TR416 TR417 TR417E TR425E TR427 TR427E TR500 TR511E TR512E TR515E TR516 TR516E TR517 TR555 TR57 TR610 TR617 TR617E TR618 TR618E TR640E TR67 TR710 TR713E TR716 TR717E TR718 TR718E TR728 TR728E TR730E TR76 TR760E TR810E TR818 TR840E TR845E TR87 TR910 TR913E TR917 TR918E TR930 TR940\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick charge with automatic constant current control prevents the battery from overcharging, over-discharge, overheating, over the current, over-voltage, short circuit, and electric shock\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e(2) Replacement Battery for Sony NP-F550\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh capacity and rechargeable Li-ion Battery with premium cell.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy to carry when out or traveling.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCapacity: 2600mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage: DC 7.4V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e(1) USB Dual Battery Charger\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe smart charging LED indicates when charging is completed and prevents the battery from overcharging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA convenient USB Cable allows you to charge wherever there is a USB jack, just connect with your desktop, notebook, or cellphone adapter.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInput: 5V - 2.1A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput CH1: 8.4V - 0.6A - 5W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: Plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003ePackage Contents\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x Replacement Batteries for Sony NP-F550\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x USB Dual Battery Charger\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x USB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c\/strong\u003e The video monitor, camcorder, LED light panel, and ring light are NOT included\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ctextarea id=\"BFI_DATA\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 1px; display: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/textarea\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"WidgetFloaterPanels\" translate=\"no\" style=\"display: none; text-align: left; direction: ltr; visibility: hidden;\" class=\"LTRStyle\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"WidgetFloater\" style=\"display: none;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"WidgetLogoPanel\"\u003e\n\u003cspan id=\"WidgetTranslateWithSpan\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTRANSLATE with \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cimg id=\"FloaterLogo\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e \u003cspan id=\"WidgetCloseButton\" title=\"Exit Translation\"\u003ex\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"LanguageMenuPanel\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"DDStyle_outer\"\u003e\n\u003cinput name=\"LanguageMenu_svid\" type=\"text\" id=\"LanguageMenu_svid\" style=\"display: none;\" autocomplete=\"on\" value=\"en\"\u003e \u003cinput name=\"LanguageMenu_textid\" type=\"text\" id=\"LanguageMenu_textid\" style=\"display: none;\" autocomplete=\"on\"\u003e \u